1
00:00:39,957 --> 00:00:44,862
SURELY TOMORROW

2
00:00:44,862 --> 00:00:44,962
SURELY TOMORROW

3
00:00:47,047 --> 00:00:50,342
DARURAT

4
00:00:51,343 --> 00:00:53,220
Ji-woo…

5
00:01:21,624 --> 00:01:24,168
Hei, kau sudah bangun?

6
00:01:25,461 --> 00:01:26,670
Kenapa aku di sini?

7
00:01:26,754 --> 00:01:28,088
Kenapa…

8
00:01:29,381 --> 00:01:31,258
Kenapa kau melakukan itu?

9
00:01:31,842 --> 00:01:34,762
Kak Se-yeong, sedang apa kau di sini?

10
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,932
Kenapa kita…

11
00:01:38,015 --> 00:01:39,809
Kyeong-do menggendongmu kemari.

12
00:01:45,314 --> 00:01:46,315
Ji-woo,

13
00:01:47,316 --> 00:01:50,069
aku harus pergi karena Dong-won demam.

14
00:01:50,736 --> 00:01:53,906
Tapi Kyeong-do di sini,
pastikan kau diobati, mengerti?

15
00:01:53,989 --> 00:01:56,200
Maaf, Kak. Pergilah.

16
00:01:56,283 --> 00:01:58,577
Tak perlu minta maaf.

17
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:03,123
Kepalaku sakit.

18
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,755
Turunkan aku di sana.

19
00:02:13,008 --> 00:02:14,426
Kau yakin bisa berjalan?

20
00:02:14,510 --> 00:02:15,386
Ya.

21
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:19,014
Hei, Seo Ji-woo.

22
00:02:24,937 --> 00:02:28,649
Kenapa kau minum obat dengan alkohol?
Apa yang kau pikirkan?

23
00:02:29,733 --> 00:02:32,152
Jika Kak Se-yeong tak datang,
kau bisa celaka.

24
00:02:32,236 --> 00:02:34,530
Apa suaramu makin lantang saat tua?

25
00:02:38,784 --> 00:02:41,787
Baik. Lalu obatnya. Kenapa kau minum itu?

26
00:02:43,956 --> 00:02:45,541
Karena ibuku datang.

27
00:02:46,292 --> 00:02:49,211
Aku sangat tidak menyukainya.
Dia membuatku kesal.

28
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,924
Ibu kami bukan ibu yang baik.

29
00:02:54,008 --> 00:02:56,260
Aku bukan bunuh diri, jangan berlebihan.

30
00:02:58,512 --> 00:02:59,513
Berlebihan?

31
00:03:01,181 --> 00:03:03,767
Benar, aku berlebihan
dan berlari menggendongmu.

32
00:03:03,851 --> 00:03:07,313
Aku tak bisa tidur.
Bahkan setelah minum obat tidur.

33
00:03:07,396 --> 00:03:10,024
Jadi, kuminum satu lagi,
tapi masih tak bisa tidur.

34
00:03:11,525 --> 00:03:13,360
Lalu itu terjadi.

35
00:03:13,986 --> 00:03:16,113
Benarkah? Itu terjadi karena kau mabuk?

36
00:03:16,196 --> 00:03:18,908
Berapa kali harus kukatakan,
Lee Kyeong-do sialan?

37
00:03:19,909 --> 00:03:22,536
Aku sudah lelah. Jangan mengomeliku.

38
00:03:25,414 --> 00:03:29,126
"Lee Kyeong-do sialan," membuang waktumu.
Untuk apa aku repot-repot?

39
00:03:32,212 --> 00:03:33,297
Pergilah.

40
00:04:13,295 --> 00:04:14,672
Dasar gila.

41
00:04:26,016 --> 00:04:27,017
Hei.

42
00:04:31,855 --> 00:04:33,107
Hei.

43
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:35,401
Overdosis obat tidur setelah minum miras?

44
00:04:35,484 --> 00:04:37,945
Kau mau semua orang tahu?
Perlu kutulis artikel?

45
00:04:38,028 --> 00:04:39,321
Diam dan dengarkan.

46
00:04:41,323 --> 00:04:43,826
Manusia jadi bodoh saat minum alkohol.

47
00:04:44,576 --> 00:04:45,953
Tak apa jika sewajarnya.

48
00:04:46,036 --> 00:04:50,290
Tapi ada yang tak bisa berhenti.
Seperti Ji-woo dan Kyeong-do.

49
00:04:52,376 --> 00:04:56,296
Pesta ganja tahun 2018,
kau pikir kenapa kau ke sana?

50
00:04:56,380 --> 00:05:00,884
Kau bahkan tak merokok.
Kau mabuk, lalu tak tahu pergi ke mana.

51
00:05:00,968 --> 00:05:04,096
Bayangkan jika kau merokok,
kau pasti dalam masalah.

52
00:05:04,179 --> 00:05:06,056
Kau tak akan minum jika tak ada sisa.

53
00:05:07,558 --> 00:05:12,354
Dasar gila, kenapa tak sadar
berapa obat tidur yang kau minum?

54
00:05:12,438 --> 00:05:14,231
Kau mengumpulkan artikelku?

55
00:05:14,815 --> 00:05:19,111
Bagaimana dengan permen karet
saat acara busana? Dari mana kau tahu?

56
00:05:19,194 --> 00:05:22,448
Coba saja beli alkohol lagi.
Aku akan kembali dan buang semuanya.

57
00:05:22,531 --> 00:05:25,075
Kau siapa? Kenapa kau begini?

58
00:05:25,159 --> 00:05:27,911
Kenapa lagi? Karena kemanusiaan.

59
00:05:32,458 --> 00:05:34,001
Keluar.

60
00:05:34,084 --> 00:05:37,504
Entah aku minum miras atau obat,
itu bukan urusanmu.

61
00:05:37,588 --> 00:05:40,299
Maka berhenti minum miras!

62
00:05:59,401 --> 00:06:02,905
Aku tahu itu sangat berat.

63
00:06:03,530 --> 00:06:05,032
Aku sangat paham.

64
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:08,660
Tapi jangan minum miras lagi.

65
00:06:10,037 --> 00:06:14,249
Itu sangat berat.

66
00:06:15,167 --> 00:06:17,711
Lebih baik berusaha sekarang
daripada nanti. Paham?

67
00:06:19,838 --> 00:06:23,175
Baik. Aku paham.

68
00:06:26,470 --> 00:06:27,471
Pergilah.

69
00:06:30,808 --> 00:06:32,976
Tidurlah dan pesan bubur.

70
00:06:33,727 --> 00:06:35,479
Perutmu dikosongkan, santai saja.

71
00:06:37,231 --> 00:06:38,690
Aku sudah muak.

72
00:06:39,191 --> 00:06:42,486
Aku paham, sekarang pergilah.
Aku jadi sadar lagi.

73
00:06:46,824 --> 00:06:49,535
Kau harus memesan bubur, mengerti?

74
00:07:02,381 --> 00:07:03,632
SURELY TOMORROW

75
00:07:03,715 --> 00:07:05,259
EPISODE 4

76
00:07:06,385 --> 00:07:08,554
Lihat? Sudah kubilang cocok untukmu.

77
00:07:08,637 --> 00:07:09,596
MUSIM SEMI, 2007

78
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,098
Semuanya cocok kupakai.

79
00:07:11,974 --> 00:07:16,562
Itu benar, tapi menurutku
ini khususnya cocok untukmu.

80
00:07:18,272 --> 00:07:19,398
Kyeong-do,

81
00:07:20,357 --> 00:07:22,234
aku tertekan saat memakai ini.

82
00:07:26,029 --> 00:07:27,239
Karena merasakan cintaku?

83
00:07:27,322 --> 00:07:29,658
Aku merasakan betapa keras
kau banting tulang.

84
00:07:29,741 --> 00:07:32,536
Kau pasti banting tulang
membawa semua piring itu.

85
00:07:34,580 --> 00:07:39,001
Daripada "banting tulang,"
aku lebih suka mendengar "bekerja keras".

86
00:07:39,501 --> 00:07:41,795
Sudahlah. Kita harus pergi.

87
00:07:42,462 --> 00:07:43,547
Ke mana?

88
00:07:45,174 --> 00:07:48,218
Lihat? Sudah kuduga warna ini
sempurna untukmu.

89
00:07:48,302 --> 00:07:49,303
Tampaknya bagus.

90
00:07:49,970 --> 00:07:54,766
Tapi jika begini, hadiahku tak disorot.
Memangnya ini bertukar hadiah?

91
00:07:56,643 --> 00:07:59,605
Baiklah. Bertukar hadiah. Bagus sekali.

92
00:08:02,274 --> 00:08:05,485
Ini 322.000 won. Kau mau bayar bagaimana?

93
00:08:05,569 --> 00:08:07,196
-Bayar penuh.
-Baik.

94
00:08:08,697 --> 00:08:12,159
Pakaian serasi.
Ini sama seperti warna gaunku, 'kan?

95
00:08:12,242 --> 00:08:13,160
DISETUJUI

96
00:08:14,161 --> 00:08:15,162
Ya.

97
00:08:17,915 --> 00:08:19,833
Ini kartu dan struknya.

98
00:08:22,044 --> 00:08:24,588
-Aku pulang.
-Sudah makan malam?

99
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:26,423
Ya, sudah.

100
00:08:27,090 --> 00:08:28,258
Pintar.

101
00:08:28,842 --> 00:08:30,469
Astaga.

102
00:08:31,803 --> 00:08:33,931
Bulan ini Ibu menghasilkan 300.000 won.

103
00:08:42,397 --> 00:08:44,107
Cuci kakimu. Bau sekali.

104
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,401
Baik.

105
00:08:58,664 --> 00:09:01,750
KAU SEDANG APA?
TERKIRIM

106
00:09:12,511 --> 00:09:15,222
Lee Kyeong-do, telepon aku. Astaga.

107
00:09:15,305 --> 00:09:18,350
Kenapa kau diam saja? Kerjakan hal lain.

108
00:09:18,433 --> 00:09:21,103
Kyeong-do, kau tahu
pohon itu yang terpenting, 'kan?

109
00:09:22,104 --> 00:09:23,105
Ya.

110
00:09:23,605 --> 00:09:25,190
Pegang yang kuat! Ini menakutkan.

111
00:09:25,691 --> 00:09:27,734
Astaga, ini butuh seharian.

112
00:09:27,818 --> 00:09:30,070
-Kau mau seharian mengurus itu?
-Baiklah.

113
00:09:30,153 --> 00:09:31,947
JOO

114
00:09:35,325 --> 00:09:36,952
Aku mau ke toilet.

115
00:09:43,292 --> 00:09:44,418
Sepertinya putus.

116
00:09:44,501 --> 00:09:46,795
Apa Kyeong-do sedang ada masalah?

117
00:09:51,633 --> 00:09:55,762
Ini halte Kantor Distrik Dobong.

118
00:10:08,817 --> 00:10:10,819
Sudah kubilang aku akan ke areamu.

119
00:10:10,902 --> 00:10:13,405
Aku tahu kau lelah.
Kau menyiapkan panggung.

120
00:10:13,488 --> 00:10:15,615
-Apakah lancar?
-Ya.

121
00:10:16,158 --> 00:10:17,826
Aku mau lihat.

122
00:10:19,453 --> 00:10:20,620
Kau menunggu lama?

123
00:10:21,288 --> 00:10:23,915
Tidak. Tak terlalu lama.

124
00:10:23,999 --> 00:10:25,000
Baiklah.

125
00:10:27,377 --> 00:10:29,379
Kalian menyiapkannya bersama?

126
00:10:29,463 --> 00:10:31,923
Ya, aku cuma…

127
00:10:32,507 --> 00:10:34,134
melakukan yang disuruh.

128
00:10:34,217 --> 00:10:35,552
Ada kejadian lucu?

129
00:10:37,095 --> 00:10:40,682
Tidak. Aku cuma sibuk.

130
00:10:45,312 --> 00:10:48,148
Ayo makan. Aku belum makan malam.

131
00:10:51,985 --> 00:10:54,154
Ada tempat donkaseu enak di sana.

132
00:10:54,946 --> 00:10:57,115
Tapi aku mau topoki.

133
00:10:59,159 --> 00:11:02,746
Ayo makan donkaseu.
Kutraktir karena kau sudah ke areaku.

134
00:11:11,129 --> 00:11:12,798
Kau sangat suka topoki.

135
00:11:13,632 --> 00:11:14,633
Ayo masuk.

136
00:11:14,716 --> 00:11:21,348
TOPOKI
BUNSIK

137
00:11:31,566 --> 00:11:32,567
Kenapa? Tak enak?

138
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,277
Bukan.

139
00:11:35,987 --> 00:11:37,614
Kukira kau lapar.

140
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:41,243
-Apa kau mau donkaseu…
-Kau kenapa?

141
00:11:42,702 --> 00:11:43,578
Apa?

142
00:11:45,038 --> 00:11:47,624
Kau tahu aku suka topoki.

143
00:11:48,417 --> 00:11:50,710
Jadi, kita makan itu dua kali sehari.

144
00:11:54,881 --> 00:11:55,799
Lalu?

145
00:11:58,718 --> 00:12:03,014
Kenapa kau tiba-tiba bersikeras
makan donkaseu yang jarang kita makan?

146
00:12:06,059 --> 00:12:10,397
Aku pikir kita bisa mencoba makanan lain.

147
00:12:13,942 --> 00:12:17,320
Karena aku putri JARIM Apparel,

148
00:12:18,905 --> 00:12:22,492
apa kau tiba-tiba tak nyaman
makan bunsik bersamaku, Kyeong-do?

149
00:12:36,465 --> 00:12:38,467
Kubilang aku akan menemuimu di Apgujeong.

150
00:12:39,009 --> 00:12:42,095
-Di sini terlalu…
-Lebih baik dari sekolahmu.

151
00:12:43,930 --> 00:12:45,390
-Maksudku…
-Apa?

152
00:12:47,893 --> 00:12:49,603
Kau mau menyamai level?

153
00:12:58,862 --> 00:13:00,864
Kyeong-do. Lee Kyeong-do.

154
00:13:00,947 --> 00:13:02,115
Lalu aku harus apa?

155
00:13:04,618 --> 00:13:05,869
Kau pikirkan perasaanku?

156
00:13:07,078 --> 00:13:09,789
Semua orang di sini seperti aku

157
00:13:11,124 --> 00:13:12,584
dan keluargaku.

158
00:13:13,168 --> 00:13:16,379
Ini semua di luar…

159
00:13:18,131 --> 00:13:21,426
Ji-woo, berikan aku waktu
untuk terbiasa dulu.

160
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,511
"Terbiasa"?

161
00:13:23,303 --> 00:13:25,764
Kau butuh terbiasa melihat seseorang?

162
00:13:25,847 --> 00:13:28,975
Entah aku terlalu muda untuk tahu atau…

163
00:13:29,601 --> 00:13:30,560
terlalu miskin.

164
00:13:30,644 --> 00:13:32,270
Astaga…

165
00:13:32,896 --> 00:13:36,399
Kenapa kau jadi seperti ini?
Kenapa kau begini?

166
00:13:36,483 --> 00:13:37,484
Ji-woo.

167
00:13:38,902 --> 00:13:42,280
Karena kau mengunjungi areaku,

168
00:13:42,364 --> 00:13:46,284
aku mau mentraktirmu donkaseu enak.
Kenapa kau malah tak nyaman?

169
00:13:46,368 --> 00:13:49,996
Aku lebih suka topoki daripada donkaseu.
Aku selalu suka itu!

170
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:53,959
Aku tahu! Tapi aku mau
membelikanmu donkaseu!

171
00:13:54,042 --> 00:13:57,671
Aku sudah memikirkannya sejak di sekolah.
Aku bahkan meminjam…

172
00:13:59,172 --> 00:14:00,507
uang dari teman-teman.

173
00:14:02,717 --> 00:14:05,178
Makanlah saja.

174
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:08,640
Buat aku merasa bangga.
Apa itu tidak boleh?

175
00:14:14,854 --> 00:14:15,981
Sial.

176
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:20,193
Maaf.

177
00:14:21,528 --> 00:14:25,282
Aku cuma tak tahu harus bagaimana.

178
00:14:25,365 --> 00:14:29,077
Apanya? Apa yang begitu sulit?

179
00:14:30,996 --> 00:14:34,207
Kaus yang kau belikan untukku.
Kau tanya kenapa tak kupakai.

180
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,544
Itu 322.000 won.

181
00:14:38,545 --> 00:14:41,381
Itu sebesar penghasilan ibuku
dari sampingannya.

182
00:14:44,175 --> 00:14:45,302
Sebenarnya,

183
00:14:45,927 --> 00:14:49,264
aku tahu seharusnya aku
tak bersikap seperti ini.

184
00:14:51,349 --> 00:14:55,020
Tapi orang tuaku
selalu bekerja keras dan itu…

185
00:14:56,730 --> 00:14:58,607
Itu alami bagiku.

186
00:15:00,066 --> 00:15:03,278
Tapi setelah bertemu denganmu,

187
00:15:04,279 --> 00:15:06,281
semua yang dulu alami…

188
00:15:09,242 --> 00:15:10,910
jadi terasa sangat berbeda.

189
00:15:21,129 --> 00:15:22,130
Maaf.

190
00:15:22,839 --> 00:15:25,216
Ini bukan salahmu, tapi aku…

191
00:15:35,769 --> 00:15:36,978
Maaf.

192
00:15:39,314 --> 00:15:41,399
Tidak, aku…

193
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:42,984
Maaf.

194
00:15:47,405 --> 00:15:50,325
Kyeong-do, maaf.

195
00:15:51,284 --> 00:15:53,870
Karena membelikanmu kaus 322.000 won.

196
00:15:53,953 --> 00:15:57,374
Maaf aku membelikanmu kaus itu.

197
00:15:57,457 --> 00:15:59,834
Ji-woo, itu…

198
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:04,339
Aku tak pernah memikirkan perasaanmu.

199
00:16:08,551 --> 00:16:10,679
Aku sungguh minta maaf, Kyeong-do.

200
00:16:14,015 --> 00:16:16,142
Mari bicarakan lagi nanti.

201
00:16:18,144 --> 00:16:20,939
Aku pergi dulu.

202
00:16:46,131 --> 00:16:47,132
Sial.

203
00:16:53,471 --> 00:16:56,015
Sialan.

204
00:17:14,325 --> 00:17:19,497
Nomor yang Anda tuju sedang sibuk.
Silakan tinggalkan pesan…

205
00:17:21,249 --> 00:17:23,835
Ji-woo, kau baik-baik saja?

206
00:17:24,419 --> 00:17:25,920
Kenapa tak bisa dihubungi?

207
00:17:27,672 --> 00:17:29,007
Maafkan aku.

208
00:17:29,966 --> 00:17:31,468
Bukan itu maksudku.

209
00:17:32,677 --> 00:17:34,137
Seharusnya aku memikirkannya.

210
00:17:35,221 --> 00:17:39,309
Ayo bertemu sebentar.
Kau mau bertemu di dekat rumahmu?

211
00:17:39,392 --> 00:17:40,518
Ji-woo.

212
00:17:40,602 --> 00:17:41,603
Ji-woo.

213
00:17:44,189 --> 00:17:45,356
Ji-woo.

214
00:17:46,483 --> 00:17:47,984
Pak Kim!

215
00:17:48,067 --> 00:17:49,319
Pak Kim!

216
00:17:49,903 --> 00:17:51,070
Ya, Bu.

217
00:18:36,741 --> 00:18:37,742
Ji-woo.

218
00:18:48,628 --> 00:18:51,297
Aku… akan pergi.

219
00:18:56,427 --> 00:18:57,762
Aku akan ke New York.

220
00:19:01,558 --> 00:19:02,559
Baik.

221
00:19:11,025 --> 00:19:12,569
Ya, Sekretaris Yang.

222
00:19:13,820 --> 00:19:16,573
Siapkan perjalanan Ji-woo ke New York. Ya.

223
00:19:17,532 --> 00:19:20,910
Lebih cepat, lebih baik. Ya.

224
00:19:45,476 --> 00:19:47,520
TIKET NAIK

225
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:57,822
Mohon perhatiannya, Penerbangan 611…

226
00:20:41,616 --> 00:20:43,034
Bagus.

227
00:20:44,535 --> 00:20:45,578
Hei, tunggu…

228
00:20:45,662 --> 00:20:49,082
Permisi. Menyingkir dari lapangan! Hei!

229
00:20:50,875 --> 00:20:51,876
Lewati saja.

230
00:20:56,506 --> 00:20:59,884
Kyeong-do, bahagialah.

231
00:21:02,637 --> 00:21:03,972
Aku juga akan bahagia.

232
00:21:38,006 --> 00:21:39,674
LEE KYEONG-DO
PESAN BARU

233
00:21:45,096 --> 00:21:49,475
LAPORAN ALKOHOLISME USIA 20-AN DAN 30-AN
ALKOHOLIK MEMBAYAR UNTUK BELI RACUN

234
00:21:49,559 --> 00:21:51,185
Sialan.

235
00:21:54,856 --> 00:21:55,898
PESAN BARU

236
